00:14:50.370 --> 00:14:52.450
Jika Anda dapat memberikan bukti terdokumentasi

00:14:52.450 --> 00:14:54.350
tentang red teaming multimodal berkelanjutan,

00:14:54.490 --> 00:14:56.410
